      "title": "G.S. Auto International Limited Announces Management Changes, February 7, 2026",
      "body": "G S Auto International Limited approved the appointment of Ms. Jasmine Kaur, Company Secretary (holding Membership No. A79557) as Company Secretary & Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from February 7, 2026. Ms. Jasmine Kaur is a Member of ICSI (Membership No.: A79557) and holds Bachelor’s degree in Commerce from University of Delhi. The Board of Directors noted the cessation of Mr. Harkirat Singh Ryait, Executive Director (DIN: 07275740) as the Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from February 7, 2026. The Board of Directors approved these changes in their meeting held on February 7, 2026.",
