      "date": "2026-01-31T22:14:38.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.10 (vs ₹0.34 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.10 (up from ₹0.34 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹397.1m (up 12% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹7.35m (up 49% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.9% (up from 1.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 108% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 27% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
